        <name>VSYNC_DISABLE_SPIN_ANNOTATION</name>
        <briefdescription>
<para>disables await_while and await_do annotations. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>If we are verifying code, await_while and await_do macros add the necessary annotations to verify the termination of await loops with GenMC &gt; 0.6.</para>
<para>GenMC 0.8 and below has issues automatically detecting await loops. With spin annotation, loops are properly annotated. Use disable-spin-assume and -check-liveness GenMC options. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
